// tests/lang/stdlib/until_ctrl_c.funny -- RUNTIME_PLAN.md R5. A golden cannot
// press Ctrl-C, so this checks everything up to that point: asking gives a
// pending `otw`, asking twice gives two different ones, and nothing settles
// while nobody has pressed anything. The other half is checked by hand, and
// written down in the CHANGELOG entry.
gimme computer

yo stop = computer.until_ctrl_c()
yap what_is_it(stop)
yap stop

yo again = computer.until_ctrl_c()
yap again == stop
yap stop
